{"name": "We Need a Bigger Ship", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b04288111db6568cd306e6ff097ffc07.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b04288111db6568cd306e6ff097ffc07.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b04288111db6568cd306e6ff097ffc07.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It starts small: a little ship, a few empty slots and one gun. Then the waves arrive, and it becomes clear you need a bigger ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/aba229d396f432d6e057a8c5c4b6a0f4.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/aba229d396f432d6e057a8c5c4b6a0f4.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/aba229d396f432d6e057a8c5c4b6a0f4.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every weapon, support and bag takes up room on your ship's grid. Turn pieces to make them fit, set supports against the weapons they boost, and snap on bags of new shapes to grow the hull. A good layout is the difference between a tin can and a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/4dec4fc9bf1b22823f7ffe71ad65c1f7.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/4dec4fc9bf1b22823f7ffe71ad65c1f7.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/4dec4fc9bf1b22823f7ffe71ad65c1f7.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/36c8767532fad89dcfd2bab5b7d51133.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/36c8767532fad89dcfd2bab5b7d51133.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/36c8767532fad89dcfd2bab5b7d51133.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put a weapon beside the right parts and hold its forge badge: they fuse into a stronger weapon. A Needler becomes a Gatling Needler, a Rail Driver an Impaler Rail, and a Nova Mortar a Hellfire Mortar, which can be forged again into a Doomsday Mortar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/d0d29388238bb145ac93c82f36eb5692.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/d0d29388238bb145ac93c82f36eb5692.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/d0d29388238bb145ac93c82f36eb5692.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/e0be60aeec2500dac4feca850dc0967d.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/e0be60aeec2500dac4feca850dc0967d.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/e0be60aeec2500dac4feca850dc0967d.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign</strong>: build between rounds, then hold the line against waves of enemies, with a boss every fifth threat level. Fly your pilot yourself or hand the controls to the autopilot. Five acts lead to the Leviathan at threat 50. You have five lives, and each act boss you beat gives one back. After that, keep going in Endless for as long as your ship holds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranked</strong>: your base against other bases, matched to your rank. Hit their core, shoot their fire out of the sky, and reach 10 wins before 5 losses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill mode</strong>: endless, with no bosses and no way to lose. Leaks only dent the shield. Fly it yourself or let it fly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/5b0b125dc177e6682ad2dceb0217b93b.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/5b0b125dc177e6682ad2dceb0217b93b.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/5b0b125dc177e6682ad2dceb0217b93b.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/485c9cfddc315632f9e220c6a8c63f72.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/485c9cfddc315632f9e220c6a8c63f72.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/485c9cfddc315632f9e220c6a8c63f72.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Ranked, lasers meet in mid-air, missile swarms fan out and curve in, and glass shields crack under fire until one base blows apart. Climb eight ranks, from Bronze to the very top: Bigger Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/781b22214ff5d420479f70b836499753.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/781b22214ff5d420479f70b836499753.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/781b22214ff5d420479f70b836499753.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b79ab2932b759b1485164d9f4e2fb8cd.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b79ab2932b759b1485164d9f4e2fb8cd.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/b79ab2932b759b1485164d9f4e2fb8cd.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nine pilots, each with its own way of shooting and its own starting kit: Outrider's straight shots, Trident's poison multishot, Spearhead's piercing lances, Whirlwind's rapid fire, Rearguard's all-round guns, Blastlance's explosives, Ricochet's bouncing orbs, Scattershot's splitting pellets and Bulwark's ram.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"364\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/6999fd7765d95a0da56337a9075d13d8.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/6999fd7765d95a0da56337a9075d13d8.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/6999fd7765d95a0da56337a9075d13d8.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/97bfb517de09f3e304f82525a807bef0.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/97bfb517de09f3e304f82525a807bef0.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/97bfb517de09f3e304f82525a807bef0.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foot soldiers, cavalry, shield bearers and armored giants. Ratters, Spore Hulks, Gravity Wells and Worms. Burrowers, Leeches, Jammers, Twinlinks, Menders, Lobbers, Phantoms and Shifters. Eight elites, from Brutes and Colossi to Plague Hulks and the Great Worm. And ten bosses, from the Brood Mother and the Siege Titan to the Dreadnought and, last of all, the Leviathan. Each one asks something different of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/c2365d05afa87773cd6ece37a0a591de.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/a67242dc7a8f391824ebf127cc41f509.poster.avif?t=1795184105\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/a67242dc7a8f391824ebf127cc41f509.webm?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/extras/a67242dc7a8f391824ebf127cc41f509.mp4?t=1795184105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">49 weapons and 140 supports, forged ones included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bags in different shapes to grow your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 pilots with their own weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Campaign of five acts and 10 bosses, then Endless</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Campaign, Ranked and Chill mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1x, 2x and 4x fight speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Collection of every item, bag and forge recipe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 languages</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Your ship is your backpack. Cram weapons, supports and bags onto its grid, link them into combos and forge bigger guns, then hold off waves of enemies and giant bosses. Take your build into Ranked against other players' ships. It starts tiny. You'll need a bigger ship.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5551460/51b7347ab3a04aa3c99f3bdf0c7f2eab9da6cb0e/header.jpg?t=1795184105", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Strategy", "Inventory Management", "PvP", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Tower Defense"], "developers": "Skrrrrr", "publishers": "Skrrrrr", "release_date": "Nov 30, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5551460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/AHjZ5-n_ZMk", "first_seen": 1795129200.0, "review_rank": 9}